# C/C++/AscendC 使用四空格缩进、120 列行宽和函数大括号换行。
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 120
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
AccessModifierOffset: -4
SortIncludes: false
BreakBeforeBraces: Custom
BraceWrapping:
  AfterFunction: true
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
